{"id":"4e7f82cf7cfd5c00","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-downward-absolute.md","title":"ZFC Downward Absolute","display":"df-zfc-downward-absolute — ZFC Downward Absolute","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-downward-absolute","aliases":["58-df-zfc-downward-absolute"],"display":"df-zfc-downward-absolute — ZFC Downward Absolute","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-substructure.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-downward-absolute"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-downward-absolute</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-downward-absolute — ZFC Downward Absolute"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"563f382027630287\" href=\"?note=563f382027630287\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-substructure.md\">../batch13/58-df-substructure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,L,\\varphi,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N \\in V\">\\(M,N,L,\\varphi,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Substructure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Substructure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DownwardAbsolute}_S \\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{DownwardAbsolute}_S \\subseteq V^8\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}downward\\text{-}absolute}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{DownwardAbsolute}_S(\\varphi,M,N,L,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(M,N,L)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(N,L,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N)\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(M,\\beta)\\to\n(\\operatorname{Sat}_N(\\varphi,\\beta)\\to\n\\operatorname{Sat}_M(\\varphi,\\beta))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}downward\\text{-}absolute}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{DownwardAbsolute}_S(\\varphi,M,N,L,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(M,N,L)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(N,L,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N)\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(M,\\beta)\\to\n(\\operatorname{Sat}_N(\\varphi,\\beta)\\to\n\\operatorname{Sat}_M(\\varphi,\\beta))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Downward absoluteness compares the same formula and the same parameter assignment in a substructure and its ambient structure; both satisfaction implementations are explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-substructure.md","status":"resolved","id":"563f382027630287","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-substructure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,N,L,\\varphi,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Substructure}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DownwardAbsolute}_S \\subseteq V^8","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}downward\\text{-}absolute}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{DownwardAbsolute}_S(\\varphi,M,N,L,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Substructure}_S(M,N,L)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(N,L,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N)\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(M,\\beta)\\to\n(\\operatorname{Sat}_N(\\varphi,\\beta)\\to\n\\operatorname{Sat}_M(\\varphi,\\beta))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1495,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1860","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-downward-absolute.md|58-df-zfc-downward-absolute]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["563f382027630287","8b6a90316aad78a4","64f35ba2e87964e0"]}